# Per-regulator XLSX templates land here as each Phase 16 sub-plan phase (10-13, 18, 20-21, 26) ships.
# Naming convention is documented on RegulatoryTemplateService (Javadoc + VERSION_PATTERN regex):
#   report-templates/{regulator}/{report-key-kebab}-v_{yyyy-MM-dd}.xlsx
# Synthetic templates use -v_SYNTHETIC_{yyyy-MM-dd}.xlsx — Angular renders a warning banner on those.
